* test(movie): expect 8 frames from the slow-capture film test (#2329)

42486db made film() fill every grid slot before the endpoint, but this
test kept its old count of 7. Its fake clock advances 0.01 s per capture
and 0.02 s per sleep, so the prompt is seen at 1.01 s, the 0.4 s hold
ends at 1.41 s, and slots 0.0-1.4 s make 8 frames. The test has failed
on every run since 42486db.

